@keboliu Could you please help review this PR? Thanks!
This PR fixes the VMOD unit-test failures on master. The tests introduced in #30449 passed before #27433 was merged. After #27433 landed, those tests started invoking a new firmware security-attribute query that was not mocked, causing the failures.
This PR adds the missing mock and regression coverage without changing production behavior

